@startuml gestion-annonces-sequence
title Sequence - Gestion des annonces annonceur (/property)

actor "Annonceur" as User
participant "PropertyPage (/property)" as UI
participant "useAdManagement" as Hook
participant "AdManagementService" as Service
participant "API /api/property/list" as API
database "Firestore" as DB

== Chargement initial ==
User -> UI: Ouvre /property
UI -> Hook: init(filters, sort, pagination)
Hook -> Service: loadAds(query)
Service -> API: GET /api/property/list?...params
API -> DB: query annonces createdBy + filtres
DB --> API: items + nextCursor + total
API --> Service: payload
Service --> Hook: adsPage
Hook --> UI: render list + stats

== Recherche/Filtres ==
User -> UI: Saisit recherche / modifie filtre
UI -> Hook: updateQuery(newParams)
Hook -> Service: loadAds(newParams)
Service -> API: GET /api/property/list?...newParams
API -> DB: query mise a jour
DB --> API: nouveau resultat
API --> Service: payload
Service --> Hook: adsPage
Hook --> UI: refresh liste

== Action annonce ==
User -> UI: Active/Archive/Edite/Supprime
UI -> Hook: runAction(adId, action)
Hook -> Service: updateAdState(adId, action)
Service -> API: PATCH/DELETE /api/property/{id}
API -> DB: update document
DB --> API: ok
API --> Service: success
Service --> Hook: success
Hook --> UI: toast + update optimiste + refresh stats

== Pagination ==
User -> UI: Scroll / clique "Voir plus"
UI -> Hook: loadNextPage(cursor)
Hook -> Service: loadAds(cursor)
Service -> API: GET /api/property/list?cursor=...
API -> DB: query startAfter(cursor)
DB --> API: next items + nextCursor
API --> Service: payload
Service --> Hook: append items
Hook --> UI: render page suivante

@enduml
